      "title": "QCustomPlot: Fix some warnings in upstream code",
      "message": "QCustomPlot: Fix some warnings in upstream code\n\nQPainter::HighQualityAntialiasing is obsolete and ignored\n(https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qpainter.html#RenderHint-enum) since\nat least 5.6, so use Antialiasing instead, as indicated by the docs.\n(https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.6/qpainter.html#RenderHint-enum)\n\n(ported from commit d0088585b3df7be3efdc79037eead2a716b06ea6)\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-04-06T07:16:37.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2022-11-23T01:02:25.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/5af458725595675bbb39af4a771e7f9d4a2e79d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "69592805810d57743d8d825da85b3b84ea6e8c49",
      "short_id": "69592805",
      "created_at": "2022-11-23T01:02:25.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "ea7bec688ac1cb24b78b14165a6d924bcc4540de"
      ],
      "title": "QCustomPlot: Fix Clang Warnings",
      "message": "QCustomPlot: Fix Clang Warnings\n\nqcustomplot.cpp:34001:37: warning: The left operand of '-' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\nqcustomplot.cpp:34001:37: warning: The right operand of '-' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\n\n(ported from commit a0328bdb0373bda83a7b63900090871ddda38af5)\n\nqcustomplot.cpp:26643:9: warning: 1st function call argument is an uninitialized value [core.CallAndMessage]\nqcustomplot.cpp:27752:11: warning: 1st function call argument is an uninitialized value [core.CallAndMessage]\nqcustomplot.cpp:27779:11: warning: 1st function call argument is an uninitialized value [core.CallAndMessage]\nqcustomplot.cpp:34087:7: warning: 2nd function call argument is an uninitialized value [core.CallAndMessage]\n\n(ported from commit 075ee9138a1d5671d0873b05f28b3e2c86bc9558)\n\nqcustomplot.cpp:22400:17: warning: The left operand of '>' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\nqcustomplot.cpp:22400:17: warning: The right operand of '>' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\nqcustomplot.cpp:35170:17: warning: The left operand of '>' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\nqcustomplot.cpp:35170:17: warning: The right operand of '>' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\n\n(ported from commit 6fd41888049b8b1e780b2fbe0e86f0ac7865523e)\n",
      "author_name": "Alexis La Goutte",
      "author_email": "alexis.lagoutte@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-01-08T16:04:11.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2022-11-23T01:02:25.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/69592805810d57743d8d825da85b3b84ea6e8c49"
